  L ==> S["2 · 파일 삭제"]
  S ==> A["3 · 인증 삭제"]
  S -. "미완료분" .-> W["크론 워커<br/>배치 재시도 (멱등)"]
  W -. "재실행" .-> S
  style CP fill:#eaf1ff,stroke:#0d6efd,stroke-width:1.5px
  style R3 fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#d39e00,stroke-width:1.5px
  style L fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,stroke-width:1.5px
